DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261208T103000
UID:4d5bfa99acde2ebb6e51ddc9c32a0d70@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Marketing today requires speed\, relevance\, and consistency- 
 and AI is quickly becoming an essential tool for reaching the right custom
 ers at the right time. This session focuses on how AI can strengthen custo
 mer acquisition efforts while improving efficiency across marketing channe
 ls. This workshop explores pratical ways to use AI for predictive targetin
 g\, content creation\, and ad optimization. Participants will learn how to
  apply AI tools to build smarter campaigns\, reduce guesswork\, and focus 
 marketing efforts where they matter most. This session is idea for busines
 s owners\, marketers\, and anyone responsible for driving growth through c
 ustomer acquisition. No technical background is required- just a willinges
 s to experiment and refine.
